      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IMA DESTROYER (1) followed a minor placing two runs ago with a win last start by 20 metres over 1800m at Globe Derby Park despite galloping in the run. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Must raise the bar but another win is on the cards. MAORI TATTOO (3) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 8 metres from the winner in fourth over 1710m at Ballarat. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Meeting a deeper field this time but he has the ability to mix it with them. NOTHING I WANT (2) must be considered after she finished third over 1800m at Globe Derby Park six days ago. QUARTARARO (10) won two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he broke and finished 40 metres away in eighth over 2230m at Globe Derby Park. Will need an ounce of luck to slot in from this tricky draw. Facing a tougher assignment but a big run is possible if his race manners improve.",
